# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
.gradle/
bin/
out/
*.class
*.jar
# The wrapper jar must be committed or `./gradlew` cannot bootstrap on a fresh
# clone. Needs the leading `**/` — the path is nested under form_poc_backend/,
# and a bare `gradle/wrapper/...` negation does not match it.
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real payer configurations — deliberately not committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# form_poc_shared/real-forms/ holds production form schemas pulled from a live
# environment (Premera, Highmark). They are real client configurations, and this
# is a POC repository, so they stay on the machine that needs them.
#
# Nothing in the build reads them: the expressiveness audit
# (docs/form-config-poc-expressiveness-audit.md) was done by
# inspection, and its findings are recorded there in full. Drop the files back
# into the path below if you want to re-derive them.
form_poc_shared/real-forms/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local overrides
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
